  "As you review the code and worked example for Enterprise Unit Economics & LTV:CAC Gateway, notice how each variable represents a concrete operational lever rather than an abstract formula. When verified shifts relative to gross, the immediate ripple effect appears in Golden and ultimately reshapes payback. Keeping that cause-and-effect chain clear in your mind makes it much easier to explain your conclusions to stakeholders who need clear, plain-language justification.",
