        "why": "Traditional geometric adstock forces maximum advertising impact to occur immediately on day zero, whereas Weibull PDF adstock allows modeling a realistic lag where consumer awareness and sales peak weeks after the campaign launch.",
        "answerIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "Traditional geometric adstock forces maximum advertising impact to occur immediately on day zero, whereas Weibull PDF adstock allows modeling a realistic lag where consumer awareness and sales peak weeks after the campaign launch."
