        "Pillar 2: 'Supply Path Efficiency & Working Media Optimization'\u2014through Tier 3 cryptographic supply path enforcement (ads.txt 1.1, complete 1-hop Schain DAGs, and automated MFA filtering), the enterprise eliminated 42 unauthorized reseller intermediaries. Average take-rate fee leakage across our programmatic pipes plummeted from 44% down to 18%, expanding the Working Media Ratio to 82%. Brand advertisers receive audited transparency, while our publishing franchise captures maximum fair-market value for its content.",
