        "Beyond immediate operating cash flows, this programmatic transformation delivers massive equity value expansion in public capital markets. In equity valuation of digital media companies, high-margin, predictable programmatic revenue is rewarded with premium valuation multiples. Adding $24.7 million in high-margin programmatic operating profit directly expands corporate EBITDA; at an industry-standard 10x EBITDA multiple, the Milestone 9 architecture creates over $247 million in shareholder enterprise value, providing our executive team with the capital reserves required for strategic digital acquisitions.",
