      "example": "In an executive board presentation, the Chief Commercial Officer leveraged the unified 5-Tier control tower to defend an $80M omnichannel retail media budget. Presenting audited proof of $18.4M in wasted cannibalization eliminated, 34% margin savings from first-price bid shading, and $210M in verified incremental retail sales, the Board unanimously approved an expanded $120M multi-year growth allocation.",
