        "why": "Deterministic guardrails enforce hard spending limits and escalate high-magnitude actions to human decision-makers, containing capital risk.",
        "explanation": "Deterministic guardrails enforce hard spending limits and escalate high-magnitude actions to human decision-makers, containing capital risk."
